# Styling Rules

## Tailwind v4

Brand colors in `@theme inline` in `globals.css`. Use semantic classes, not raw hex in components.

## Patterns

- Primary CTA: `rounded-full bg-brand-navy px-6 py-3 text-white hover:bg-brand-navy-light`
- Secondary CTA: `rounded-full border border-brand-navy/20 hover:border-brand-gold`
- Cards: `rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm`
- Headings: `text-brand-navy font-semibold tracking-tight`

## Responsive

Mobile-first. Test 375px minimum. No text below 14px.

## Avoid

- Inline styles
- Generic gray palettes that ignore brand tokens
- Dark mode until explicitly requested
